  (text "Maxiumum voltage: 8.4V * (200k/(200k+100k)) = 2.8V\nMinimum voltage: 6V * (200k/(200k+100k)) = 2.0V\n\nADC_value = (ADC_BAT * GAIN)/Vref * 4069\nfor nrf52840dongle:\nVref = 0.6V\nGAIN = 1/6 \nwe take this value because Vmax_adc = Vref*(1/GAIN)\n\nADC Value at 8.4V - 12 bit setup: 3182\nADC Value at 6.0V - 12 bit setup: 2274\n\nUsable ADC resolution - 12 bit setup: 3182 - 2274 = 908"
    (at 170.18 162.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 5e48b89d-e0f8-4c8e-b728-9951f8f9e7f3)
  )

